        "committer": {
          "name": "rsinghDDN",
          "email": "rsingh@ddn.com",
          "date": "2026-11-25 02:24:01.000000000",
          "tz": 330
        },
        "subject": "LU-18317 libcfs: parse IPv6 o2ib NIDs in userspace",
        "message": "LU-18317 libcfs: parse IPv6 o2ib NIDs in userspace\n\nThe kernel nidstrings.c learned to parse IPv6@o2ib NIDs, but the\nO2IBLND entry in the userspace copy, lib/libcfs/nidstrings.c, still\nhas no nf_str2addr_size/nf_addr2str_size handlers.  libcfs_strnid()\nthen falls back to the IPv4-only parser, so lnetctl rejects any\nIPv6 o2ib NID:\n\n  # lnetctl ping fd00:122::169@o2ib\n  descr: \"Unable to parse nidlist: invalid NID in nidstr\"\n\nAdd the IP size handlers to the userspace O2IBLND entry, matching\nSOCKLND and the kernel table.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 22667e91b1e2 (\"LU-18317 lnet: fix configure o2ib NID with IPv6 address\")\nSigned-off-by: Ravindra Singh <rsingh@ddn.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: Ib21328d0fc2389cfd4a8b898db1318ff6c29ac07\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
